usage: hostdraft.py [-h] {reply,decision,check-reply,check-decision} ...

Incomplete host protocol drafts and read-only preflight; no tool calls/commit.

positional arguments:
  {reply,decision,check-reply,check-decision}
    reply               write an explicitly incomplete host reply
    decision            write ungraded original acceptance rows
    check-reply         read-only outer protocol preflight, not acceptance
    check-decision      read-only original controller preflight, no commit

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
